# Investigation First

Before implementation:
- confirm objective and non-objectives
- identify impacted modules/contracts/boundaries
- inspect existing implementations to avoid duplication
- define acceptance criteria and validation harness
- map dependencies and blockers

Blocking policy:
- no coding with ambiguous scope
- no coding without validation strategy
